Appendix D. ECC-H Operational Checklist

1. Freeze \Theta_{\mathrm{ECC}}. The frozen object comprises: the extended model \mathcal{M}', the abstraction map \phi, the invariant list I' including I_5^{\mathrm{arch}}, I_5^{\mathrm{persist}}, and I_5^{\mathrm{traj}}, the event ontology \mathcal{E}, the rupture rule \mathcal{R}, the classification and prediction rule \mathcal{C}, the admissible abstraction family \Phi_{\mathrm{adm}}, and the anti-overfitting threshold \theta_{\mathrm{adm}}.
2. Publish hashes. Publish SHA-256(\Theta_{\mathrm{ECC}}) and SHA-256 of the event-extraction script on a public timestamping service before any holdout transcript is opened.
3. Confirm temporal condition. Verify t_{\mathrm{freeze}}<t_{\mathrm{holdout\ exposure}}.
4. Blinded event extraction. Perform event extraction on D_{\mathrm{holdout}} before unblinding to \Theta_{\mathrm{ECC}}. Freeze the extraction script and its output against the published hash.
5. Evaluate mechanistic separation. Compute \mathrm{MechSep}_{\mathcal{F}}(D_{\mathrm{train}},D_{\mathrm{holdout}}) with respect to the pre-registered family \mathcal{F}. The family contains at least: unintended live internet path; repurposeable shared state; unmediated cross-agent flow; privilege escalation via vendor zero-day; lateral movement via deserialization. The sharing decision is made from primary-source artefacts alone and is timestamped with the freeze.
6. Compute component-wise holdout result vector. For each component P_i of the pre-registered prediction P=(P_1,\dots,P_k), record \mathrm{hr}(P_i,O_i)\in\{\mathrm{CONFIRMED},\mathrm{FALSIFIED},\mathrm{INDETERMINATE}\}.
7. Apply pre-registered decision threshold. Aggregate under the confirmation fraction \theta_{\mathrm{holdout}}\in(0,1]. The extension is supported if the fraction of CONFIRMED components is at least \theta_{\mathrm{holdout}}, falsified if at least one component is FALSIFIED and the fraction of CONFIRMED components is below \theta_{\mathrm{holdout}}, and indeterminate otherwise.
8. Verify hash equality. Confirm \Theta_{\mathrm{ECC}}^{\mathrm{post}}=\Theta_{\mathrm{ECC}}^{\mathrm{pre}} against the published hash.
9. Report the full vector. Report the component-wise vector and the aggregated verdict; do not report a single binary verdict.

Recommended first holdout unit. Train = OpenAI–Hugging Face (both phases). Holdout = the Irregular evaluation-environment class (Anthropic four incidents plus any later Meta or OpenAI incidents sharing the same partner and misconfiguration). Because \mathrm{MechSep}_{\mathcal{F}}=0 inside the class, the entire class is treated as a single unit.

